            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "reditus, reditūs — \"a return, a coming back\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Uxor nautae reditum marītī exspectat. The sailor's wife waits for her husband's return."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fourth declension, masculine: reditus, reditūs m. Also income, what comes back from land."
            }
          ]
        },
