              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "peregrīnor is built on peregrīnus 'foreign' (EtymDB), which goes back to peregrē 'abroad', from per- 'through, beyond' and ager 'land' (Lewis & Short). English pilgrim comes from peregrīnus."
            }
